{"1593370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stickforge", "steam_appid": 1593370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stickforge – the online multiplayer stickman game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Stickforge, where the laws of physics are more like <i>guidelines</i>. If you’ve ever wanted to create your own stickman game and battle with custom weapons, items, enemies this is your moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/adcd67c60a1802ebcf70cbeeebead36d.avif?t=1780390932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras_big/adcd67c60a1802ebcf70cbeeebead36d.avif?t=1780390932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/30254a740a59471576b826f81026c36b.avif?t=1780390932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras_big/30254a740a59471576b826f81026c36b.avif?t=1780390932 width=800 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of BattleStick, Stickforge cranks up the fun with <strong>full modding support</strong>. Design <strong>custom maps</strong>, <strong>stickman skins</strong>, <strong>weapons and items</strong>, <strong>NPCs</strong>, and <strong>scripts</strong>. Host your own server, invite friends (or total strangers), and unleash your creations in ways that would probably be illegal in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/12645549c58c01a7242b53893cb72d3c.avif?t=1780390932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras_big/12645549c58c01a7242b53893cb72d3c.avif?t=1780390932 width=800 height=308 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What’s in the toolkit?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official USA servers to play instantly with friends and NPCs. No need to be a modder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A physics-based game where stickmen bounce, break, and occasionally explode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the weapons, maps and skins of BattleStick included (50 items/weapons/skins, 11 headgears, 27 stickman skins, +10 maps).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/7066d9bc1f95d1b673e0e5f9d52e8176.poster.avif?t=1780390932\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/7066d9bc1f95d1b673e0e5f9d52e8176.webm?t=1780390932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/7066d9bc1f95d1b673e0e5f9d52e8176.mp4?t=1780390932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gameplay of the golden crossbow</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free web online version available: </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Steam Workshop support, so you can share your most original ideas with a custom mod uploader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated server hosting, because sometimes you need your own creative kingdom with your own rules. Partnership with VeryGames to bring you the best dedicated server quality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/6a2b41836992d5f8c45b9c660d648608.avif?t=1780390932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras_big/6a2b41836992d5f8c45b9c660d648608.avif?t=1780390932 width=800 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You can download for free and use &quot;Tiled&quot; editor to make Stickforge maps  by Thorbjørn Lindeijer)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can build everything you want</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to make a peaceful chatroom, build, battle, or just spawn an unreasonable number of arrows, Stickforge gives you the possibility to create your own stickman world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, in the final version of Stickforge, you will be able to create your own open world game, and link maps together, to add NPC and boss fight. Even create multiplayer co-op raids. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickforge is the ultimate multiplayer 2D stickman sandbox game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/d6d6f0141eee18c1b6d6a46f2e5fb9d2.avif?t=1780390932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras_big/d6d6f0141eee18c1b6d6a46f2e5fb9d2.avif?t=1780390932 width=800 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The creation of a new stickman skin is easy, grab your favorite drawing software (GIMP, Photoshop, Krita, ...), paint the body parts, and decide the name, rarity and price for your skin.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's planned?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickforge has infinite potential as long as the core systems are there to support the community's creativity. Dungeons, PvE, Quests and even RPG. It's all possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/de428ba3a93ecf04be246d23014d6b96.avif?t=1780390932\" width=1080 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join our community on Discord and give your ideas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/950f23343de17c68ff0a30c660e79d5e.avif?t=1780390932\" width=454 height=435 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stickforge – the online multiplayer stickman game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Stickforge, where the laws of physics are more like <i>guidelines</i>. If you’ve ever wanted to create your own stickman game and battle with custom weapons, items, enemies this is your moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/adcd67c60a1802ebcf70cbeeebead36d.avif?t=1780390932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras_big/adcd67c60a1802ebcf70cbeeebead36d.avif?t=1780390932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/30254a740a59471576b826f81026c36b.avif?t=1780390932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras_big/30254a740a59471576b826f81026c36b.avif?t=1780390932 width=800 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of BattleStick, Stickforge cranks up the fun with <strong>full modding support</strong>. Design <strong>custom maps</strong>, <strong>stickman skins</strong>, <strong>weapons and items</strong>, <strong>NPCs</strong>, and <strong>scripts</strong>. Host your own server, invite friends (or total strangers), and unleash your creations in ways that would probably be illegal in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/12645549c58c01a7242b53893cb72d3c.avif?t=1780390932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras_big/12645549c58c01a7242b53893cb72d3c.avif?t=1780390932 width=800 height=308 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What’s in the toolkit?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official USA servers to play instantly with friends and NPCs. No need to be a modder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A physics-based game where stickmen bounce, break, and occasionally explode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the weapons, maps and skins of BattleStick included (50 items/weapons/skins, 11 headgears, 27 stickman skins, +10 maps).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/7066d9bc1f95d1b673e0e5f9d52e8176.poster.avif?t=1780390932\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/7066d9bc1f95d1b673e0e5f9d52e8176.webm?t=1780390932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/7066d9bc1f95d1b673e0e5f9d52e8176.mp4?t=1780390932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gameplay of the golden crossbow</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free web online version available: </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Steam Workshop support, so you can share your most original ideas with a custom mod uploader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated server hosting, because sometimes you need your own creative kingdom with your own rules. Partnership with VeryGames to bring you the best dedicated server quality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/6a2b41836992d5f8c45b9c660d648608.avif?t=1780390932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras_big/6a2b41836992d5f8c45b9c660d648608.avif?t=1780390932 width=800 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You can download for free and use &quot;Tiled&quot; editor to make Stickforge maps  by Thorbjørn Lindeijer)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can build everything you want</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to make a peaceful chatroom, build, battle, or just spawn an unreasonable number of arrows, Stickforge gives you the possibility to create your own stickman world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, in the final version of Stickforge, you will be able to create your own open world game, and link maps together, to add NPC and boss fight. Even create multiplayer co-op raids. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickforge is the ultimate multiplayer 2D stickman sandbox game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/d6d6f0141eee18c1b6d6a46f2e5fb9d2.avif?t=1780390932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras_big/d6d6f0141eee18c1b6d6a46f2e5fb9d2.avif?t=1780390932 width=800 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The creation of a new stickman skin is easy, grab your favorite drawing software (GIMP, Photoshop, Krita, ...), paint the body parts, and decide the name, rarity and price for your skin.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's planned?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickforge has infinite potential as long as the core systems are there to support the community's creativity. Dungeons, PvE, Quests and even RPG. It's all possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/de428ba3a93ecf04be246d23014d6b96.avif?t=1780390932\" width=1080 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join our community on Discord and give your ideas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/extras/950f23343de17c68ff0a30c660e79d5e.avif?t=1780390932\" width=454 height=435 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Stickforge is a fun, physics-based 2D multiplayer online stickman game. Fight and build with other players. Create your own maps, items, and skins. Multiplayer stickman arena PVP.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/74251a6be4f00572b471704cc765472e4593a3b8/header.jpg?t=1780390932", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/6c41f3de4c41516b81885bbcd5a74de08376921b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780390932", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593370/6c41f3de4c41516b81885bbcd5a74de08376921b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780390932", "website": "https://stickforge.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</stro